# .gitignore for WPF (.NET Core / .NET 5+)
# 增强版：包含 NuGet 和构建缓存

## Visual Studio / VS Code 生成的文件
.vs/
.vscode/
*.user
*.suo
*.sln.docstates

## .NET Core / .NET 5+ 构建缓存与输出
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
*.deps.json
*.runtimeconfig.json

## NuGet 包与依赖缓存
packages/
*.nupkg
project.lock.json
project.assets.json
*.nuget.props
*.nuget.targets

## JetBrains Rider
.idea/
*.DotSettings.user

## Windows 临时文件
Thumbs.db
*.tmp